d or the number being reused, so verify it in the ticketing system.\n- The 8/3 digest, the 5/3 handoff note and the 12/1 digest mention Vantorre issues (Hartford, duplicate arrivals at door 14) without a ticket number, so they aren't listed.\n- I can only see these three sources. I can't see the ticketing system, so this isn't a complete ticket history.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000127","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
